<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(On the left, the Riverstone job description with seven numbered markers. On the right, seven matching notes. 1, the title equals track plus tier: analytics and BI, tier 1, with the automation thread. 2, a door for freshers: strong projects means a portfolio can replace experience. 3, duties are outputs: at-risk list, Chapter 13; dashboard, Chapter 16; automation, Chapter 20. 4, hidden skill: agreeing definitions is stakeholder work, Chapters 23 and 24. 5, must-haves are the keys: these decide the shortlist, score yourself on each. 6, with any tool: they care about the result, not a brand of software. 7, nice-to-haves are not rules: apply if you meet the must-haves; these are tie-breakers.)/P 779 0 R/Pg 656 0 R/K 1>>
endobj

