<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A comparison table with six rows. Goal: naive practice is "do some SQL tonight"; deliberate practice is "build a monthly total of your spending log and check it against the sum of every row". Difficulty: what already feels comfortable, versus slightly beyond what you can do unaided. Attention: half-watching a video with the phone nearby, versus full focus for a short fixed block. Feedback: none, or "it ran so it's right", versus comparing with a known answer and finding why it differs. Repetition: move on after one success, versus redo it tomorrow without looking and vary it. Record: nothing written down, versus a log of what was hard and what to try next.)/P 779 0 R/Pg 711 0 R/K 15>>
endobj

